*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0020
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-05-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 607
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0020.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY INT0020C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 WS-BNR             PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2500-SENIOR-RATE
    PERFORM 2600-FIXED-DEP
    DISPLAY "WS-BNR=" WS-BNR
    STOP RUN.
2500-SENIOR-RATE.
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS - LIMIT 82 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CA-AGE >= 55 AND WS-BAL >= 10000
        COMPUTE WS-BNR = WS-BRT + 0.0050
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-BRT TO WS-BNR
    END-IF.
2600-FIXED-DEP.
    *> FIXED DEPOSIT UPLIFT
    IF AT-FIXED
        COMPUTE WS-BNR = WS-BNR + 0.0015
    END-IF.
